      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand that you're experiencing discomfort. For the headache, you can consider taking an over-the-counter option like Advil (ibuprofen) to help alleviate the pain, as it can also reduce inflammation, which may be contributing to your headache. However, it's important to follow the recommended dosage on the package and consult with a healthcare professional, especially since you're dealing with potential ulcers, as some pain relievers are not recommended for gastric issues. In the meantime, try to avoid foods and beverages that trigger heartburn and stick to smaller meals throughout the day.",
